Add support for sunxi-ng read-only dividers. This will be
useful to the a733 oscillator detection logic.

Reviewed-by: Chen-Yu Tsai <wens@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Jerome Brunet <jbrunet@baylibre.com>
